WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.400
Does AI recommend your brand,
or your competitor?

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:04.750
I'm Robert Hu.

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:07.750
I built Recoscope to make
those answers visible.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.800
We ask ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.350
and Perplexity consistent shopper questions.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.400
Then we publish what they said.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:19.050
A brand can be mentioned most often
without ranking first.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.050
In our protein powder snapshot,

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:24.400
three ranked comparisons produced
three different first choices.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.650
We separate brand mentions
from explicit rankings,

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.400
and show the dates, prompts
and collection notes.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.950
These are captured answers,
not product-quality ratings.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.850
Subscribe for benchmark briefs.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.200
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
